general.jsonl is derived from two datasets published under the Apache License 2.0:

- LocalLLaMA/typed-decisions (https://huggingface.co/datasets/LocalLLaMA/typed-decisions)
- fastino/fast-decisions (https://huggingface.co/datasets/fastino/fast-decisions)

Examples were converted to the studio's training format by scripts/build_training_pack.py and split into "replay"
examples (mixed into fine-tuning so models keep their existing skills) and "guard" examples (used only to check that a
fine-tune has not forgotten them).
